{"id":4142,"date":"2025-06-07T03:40:14","date_gmt":"2025-06-07T03:40:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4142"},"modified":"2025-08-16T01:43:19","modified_gmt":"2025-08-16T01:43:19","slug":"doi-tac-tiktok-shop-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/doi-tac-tiktok-shop-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c TikTok Shop l\u00e0 g\u00ec? G\u1ed3m nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u00e0o?"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"P47CdszF0oeyzHxtuDTlFTsPgsg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DG8TdhuKoocZdcxsLq4lT35HgAh\">TikTok l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n nhanh hi\u1ec7n nay, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn v\u1edbi video ng\u1eafn m\u00e0 c\u00f2n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng sang l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed qua TikTok Shop. N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c nh\u1eb1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u ngay!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WfaXdeieOov8ozxJT2UlBGMwglf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c Tiktok Shop l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E0gHdXyzuosqVIxXrzulQjnJgeg\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c TikTok Shop l\u00e0 c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng ty ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn, c\u00f3 chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n trong vi\u1ec7c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok Shop. H\u1ecd gi\u00fap c\u00e1c shop t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh, t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung, ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1eadu c\u1ea7n, ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng&#8230; nh\u1eb1m t\u0103ng doanh thu v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4149\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4149\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4149\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-38.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c TikTok Shop - H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng, t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-38.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-38-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-38-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-38-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-38-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4149\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c TikTok Shop &#8211; H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng, t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O8CDdSpjXopLQVxMmeblohZHg6g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"P47CdszF0oeyzHxtuDTlFTsPgsg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-A3c9d1Sc7oXWzQxeXFLlIyCggrf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c Tiktok shop g\u1ed3m nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u00e0o?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XbWfdw1HBo7ORSxHXJcl1SsLgTe\">TikTok Shop x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111a d\u1ea1ng nh\u1eb1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. C\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ch\u00ednh bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UAtPdY4aDoSyHLxwd4DlfEQ6gpd\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 100.923%;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"138\" \/>\n<col width=\"218\" \/>\n<col width=\"357\" \/>\n<col width=\"246\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 20.7331%;\"><strong>Lo\u1ea1i \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 35.3225%;\"><strong>M\u00f4 T\u1ea3<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 40.4139%;\"><strong>Vai Tr\u00f2 &amp; D\u1ecbch V\u1ee5 Ch\u00ednh<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 71.2302%;\"><strong>V\u00ed D\u1ee5 \/ Ghi Ch\u00fa<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.7331%; text-align: left;\">TikTok Shop Partner<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3225%; text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean TikTok Shop.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.4139%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng gian h\u00e0ng, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. <br \/>\n&#8211; Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 marketing. <br \/>\n&#8211; H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. <br \/>\n&#8211; T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2302%; text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c c\u00f4ng ty agency digital marketing, n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u0111a k\u00eanh.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.7331%; text-align: left;\">TikTok Creator<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3225%; text-align: left;\">C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u00f3m s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 s\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.4139%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; T\u1ea1o video qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. <br \/>\n&#8211; Tham gia ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh affiliate. <br \/>\n&#8211; T\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2302%; text-align: left;\">Influencers, KOLs tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.7331%; text-align: left;\">Affiliate Partner<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3225%; text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n tham gia ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft cho TikTok Shop.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.4139%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; Chia s\u1ebb link s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, video gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u. <br \/>\n&#8211; Nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng qua link. <br \/>\n&#8211; M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng m\u1ea1ng l\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, t\u0103ng doanh thu.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2302%; text-align: left;\">Th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 TikTok Creator ki\u00eam Affiliate.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.7331%; text-align: left;\">Logistics Partner<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3225%; text-align: left;\">\u0110\u01a1n v\u1ecb cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, giao h\u00e0ng cho TikTok Shop.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.4139%; text-align: left;\">&#8211; \u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn kh\u00e1ch. <br \/>\n&#8211; \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o giao h\u00e0ng nhanh, ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c. <br \/>\n&#8211; Theo d\u00f5i tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i, x\u1eed l\u00fd s\u1ef1 c\u1ed1 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2302%; text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, giao nh\u1eadn nh\u01b0 Giao H\u00e0ng Nhanh, Viettel Post&#8230;<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h2>\u00a0<\/h2>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DqcOdZCvzogA5wx4mT1lzji9gHc\">Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t TikTok Marketing Partner v\u1edbi TikTok Shop Partner \u2013 C\u00e1i n\u00e0o ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p h\u01a1n?<\/h2>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-PyngdVk0boWjZkxCecjlpzXmgZb\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 99.7102%;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"199\" \/>\n<col width=\"310\" \/>\n<col width=\"368\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 17.116%;\"><strong>Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 39.9133%;\"><strong>TikTok Marketing Partner<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 124.036%;\"><strong>TikTok Shop Partner<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 17.116%;\">M\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch ch\u00ednh<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 39.9133%;\">H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, marketing tr\u00ean TikTok (qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o brand, qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m)<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 124.036%;\">H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean TikTok Shop (v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng, t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 17.116%;\">Ph\u1ea1m vi d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 39.9133%;\">T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 124.036%;\">T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng gian h\u00e0ng, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 affiliate, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh TikTok Shop<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 17.116%;\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 39.9133%;\">Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u mu\u1ed1n t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh tr\u00ean TikTok<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 124.036%;\">Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u mu\u1ed1n b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean TikTok<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 17.116%;\">T\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 39.9133%;\">Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 124.036%;\">H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng, ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh affiliate, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u quy tr\u00ecnh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 17.116%;\">K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1edbi<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 39.9133%;\">T\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem video<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 124.036%;\">T\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng qua TikTok Shop<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WywndCeleo8rxaxV4PHlKxIlgZb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u00ec n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn \u2192 TikTok Marketing Partner.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RSQpdEnmsoyC4sxPSddlnssVgCe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n t\u1eadp trung b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean TikTok v\u00e0 c\u1ea7n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng, t\u0103ng doanh thu th\u00ec ch\u1ecdn \u2192 TikTok Shop Partner (ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p h\u01a1n).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ODShdwMiGo8gQ2xQgkQlgiMXgrb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XGs6dE0OOoDQBWxGW4olgxfsgNe\">Quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlXMdByTUoffQSxLuYqlaSr5gIc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: \u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd &amp; \u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AFzjdPXYYoyrC0xFGl6lswfigrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c (c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, c\u00f4ng ty, ho\u1eb7c agency) \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd qua c\u1ed5ng TikTok Shop Partner, cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin nh\u01b0 t\u00ean doanh nghi\u1ec7p, l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c kinh doanh, kinh nghi\u1ec7m th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, v\u00e0 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd ph\u00e1p l\u00fd. TikTok Shop x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean uy t\u00edn, kinh nghi\u1ec7m, v\u00e0 ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5p thu\u1eadn, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c nh\u1eadn th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c, quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng, c\u00f9ng t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn v\u00e0 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dwkod0PCyoKgHIxsW4KlncoXgxf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n &amp; Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gian h\u00e0ng <\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfLIdxP3KoIRtsxMewclGAwHg8f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u1ec1 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau kinh doanh, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 danh m\u1ee5c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. Sau \u0111\u00f3, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Shop, thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u00ean gian h\u00e0ng, logo, v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng: ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p xu h\u01b0\u1edbng TikTok, ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 quay video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, vi\u1ebft m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u1ea5n m\u1ea1nh l\u1ee3i \u00edch. Gian<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KwSodZJxeozAPoxfbBdl9SiNgob\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Ch\u1ea1y ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YKrvdF9cIo184Xx1bXqlstGXgfe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec3n khai c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i nh\u01b0 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, flash sale, m\u00e3 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, ho\u1eb7c combo s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c livestream b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch l\u00ean k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, ch\u1ecdn th\u1eddi gian ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p (th\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0o gi\u1edd cao \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u01b0 bu\u1ed5i t\u1ed1i), v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00e1ch t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y mua s\u1eafm. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c creator, KOLs, ho\u1eb7c influencer \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 qua video ng\u1eafn, b\u00e0i \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1. Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh affiliate, khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch creator chia s\u1ebb li\u00ean k\u1ebft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean TikTok Shop.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XKOvdH9INoS0J8xzZDklzzKlg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xo7Vd5z3vouJaDxi6I2lylsUgke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ch\u1eb7t ch\u1ebd tr\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng TikTok Shop, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n giao cho logistics di\u1ec5n ra ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n nh\u01b0 Giao H\u00e0ng Nhanh, J&amp;T Express ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c logistics c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop \u0111\u1ec3 giao h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng, \u0111\u00fang h\u1eb9n, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c giai \u0111o\u1ea1n cao \u0111i\u1ec3m. X\u1eed l\u00fd khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 nh\u01b0 \u0111\u01a1n h\u1ee7y, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i, giao sai, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 theo ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch, nh\u1eb1m duy tr\u00ec s\u1ef1 h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng v\u00e0 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PzBRduyoAonbzXxKHYzlzLNQgzb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch &amp; T\u1ed1i \u01b0u<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RmrZdyqEnoejFDxXOzvlJw66gAe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cung c\u1ea5p b\u00e1o c\u00e1o chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, bao g\u1ed3m doanh thu theo s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i, livestream v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb TikTok Shop \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n t\u00edch k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem gian h\u00e0ng, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, v\u00e0 h\u00e0nh vi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua nh\u01b0 th\u1eddi gian mua.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4147\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4147\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4147\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-3.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd, thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4147\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd, thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"P47CdszF0oeyzHxtuDTlFTsPgsg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IuHOdByvWomVdIxOD1IlbWLHgPd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OPSadVfk8oRr37xgnoTlSfv1gqb\">C\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"P47CdszF0oeyzHxtuDTlFTsPgsg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EToFdHmnQo5IMRxUo90l9zD6gug\">Lemon Digital, m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng ty digital marketing h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u00e3 ghi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u1edbi vai tr\u00f2 TikTok Marketing Partner v\u00e0 TikTok Shop Partner, mang \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb s\u1ed1. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chung v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n ti\u00eau bi\u1ec3u c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uu0vdIqy3omxh1xHsgklZT9Cg1e\">(Do b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt n\u00ean k c\u00f4ng khai dc t\u00ean d\u1ef1 \u00e1n,&#8230;)<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KU7kd1LyCoBHFXxvccKlMalUgRf\"><strong>T\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu \u0111a k\u00eanh<\/strong>: Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng h\u00e0ng lo\u1ea1t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o nh\u01b0 TikTok Ads, livestream, v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung video ng\u1eafn. C\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u00e0y gi\u00fap gia t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh doanh s\u1ed1 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 c\u00e1c s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZI8AdxPa9oHpl4xtZKMlXNpZgMf\"><strong>Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch livestream v\u00e0 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi creator<\/strong>: C\u00f4ng ty \u0111\u00e3 tri\u1ec3n khai nhi\u1ec1u chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch livestream hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c KOLs, influencer v\u00e0 creator \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, t\u1ea1o hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng lan t\u1ecfa v\u00e0 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. Nh\u1eefng d\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u th\u1eddi gian ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng, v\u00e0 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng xu h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UGbKdY9z9ol1sUxRWEBlciuZgBc\"><strong>S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Mega Sales \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/strong>: Lemon Digital t\u1eebng h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi TikTok Shop \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng quy m\u00f4 l\u1edbn, quy t\u1ee5 nhi\u1ec1u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 th\u1eddi trang, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m, c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7, v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n. C\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u00e0y mang l\u1ea1i c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea1t k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u1ec1 s\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng v\u01b0\u1ee3t b\u1eadc so v\u1edbi ng\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HC7JdiRp1oukx7xHMUHlqSIzgVg\">Do t\u00ednh ch\u1ea5t b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt c\u1ee7a d\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u00ean Lemon xin ph\u00e9p kh\u00f4ng c\u00f4ng khai t\u00ean d\u1ef1 \u00e1n. Lemon Digital \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 cao nh\u1edd s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng h\u00e0ng lo\u1ea1t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, gi\u00fap h\u1ecd \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop v\u00e0 c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ed1 t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UkZMdy6IbooVMHx50GilbRFTgxe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4145\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4145\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4145\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-37.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-37.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-37-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-37-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-37-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-37-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4145\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">D\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;733af4e5-e2ac-402e-9f14-3d47d3da852e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;s